ing questions about what's  actually going on in the chinese economy  and we've been talking about lehman  brothers in the parallel there with  evergrand but maybe people are going to  start asking questions about who's too  big to fail here is it is it evergrand  or is it the communist party itself that  may be too big to fail  clifford conan and christie plattson in  frankfurt thanks to both of you  you
 

